                        <item xml:id="a3">
                           <locus target="#1r">-1r</locus>
                           <desc>Fawā'id and masā'il</desc>
                           <q>Fawā'id about: being alive of Iblīs and death of Muḥammad, making up of prayers (mentioning al-Mudābiġī), crying of gold and silver in Heaven after the fall of Adam, funeral prayer, marriage issues (question raised during a lesson), lifespan of insects, amount of time passed between the coming of different prophets, permissibility of the tayammum in case of major impurity, names of the very first Muslims.</q>
                           <note/>
                        </item>
